flowchart LR
  A[Qualified evidence] --> B[Idempotent incremental projection]
  B --> C[Current trusted operational graph]
  C --> D[Create graph revision metadata]
  D --> E[Select action relevant subgraph]
  E --> F[Canonicalize and calculate subgraph digest]
  F --> G[Bind assessment policy approval and authorization]
  G --> H{Material graph difference before execution}
  H -- no --> I[Execute bounded recovery]
  H -- nonmaterial --> I
  H -- narrowing and policy permits --> I
  H -- material safety change --> J[Invalidate authorization and reassess]
  J --> E
  I --> K[Cross layer validation and stable window]
  K --> L[Qualified post recovery observations]
  L --> B
  K --> M[Seal decision snapshot witness paths and evidence]
  M -. retained history .-> C
